type: dataset
title: "WikiClassroom (WikiAula)"
abstract: >-
  Interactive school courses that work without internet: Maths from grade 1 to grade 12, Physics and
  Chemistry from grade 8 to grade 12, as one ZIM file per language, with encyclopedia-style lessons,
  watercolour figures and generated exercises. A project of Offlined.
